Package: nmadb
Type: Package
Title: Network Meta-Analysis Database API
Version: 1.3.0
Date: 2026-11-20
Authors@R: person("Theodoros", "Papakonstantinou",
                    role = c("aut", "cre"),
                    email = "theodoros.papakonstantinou@ispm.unibe.ch",
                    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6630-6817"))
Description: Set of functions for accessing database of network meta-analyses described in 
  Petropoulou M, et al. Bibliographic study showed improving statistical methodology of network
  meta-analyses published between 1999 and 2015
  <doi:10.1016/j.jclinepi.2016.11.002>. The public catalogue is bundled with the package; Excel datasets are hosted on
  GitHub and verified by SHA-256. REDCap is used for data entry and updates.
License: GPL-3
